{"annotations":{"destructiveHint":false,"idempotentHint":true,"openWorldHint":false,"readOnlyHint":true},"description":"Complete daily Panchang: Tithi, Vara, Karana, Yoga, Nakshatra + Choghadia + Rahu Kaal + Yamaganda + Gulika + Abhijit Muhurat. Single call. Tithi, karana, yoga and nakshatra carry `endsAt` (local ISO time with offset); `sunNakshatra`, `moonrise` and `moonset` (first after sunrise, disc centre on the horizon as panchangs count it; null when the Moon does not rise or set within 30 hours). `muhurtas`: Brahma Muhurta, Pratah and Sayahna Sandhya, Vijaya, Godhuli, Nishita, `durMuhurtam`, `amritKalam` and `varjyam` (lists), each `{ start, end }` in local ISO time.\n\n[Group: Vedic]\n[Endpoint: POST /v1/vedic/panchang/full]\n[Required: date, latitude, longitude]\n[Cost: 20 credits (Tier 2)]","execution":{"taskSupport":"forbidden"},"inputSchema":{"$schema":"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#","properties":{"at":{"description":"moment (default): tithi, nakshatra, yoga and karana at date + time. sunrise: at local sunrise of that date, as a printed panchang gives them; time may be omitted.","enum":["moment","sunrise"],"type":"string"},"ayanamsa":{"description":"Sidereal school by name. Lahiri when omitted. Equivalent to ayanamsaId; send either.","enum":["fagan-bradley","lahiri","de-luce","raman","krishnamurti","kp","yukteshwar","jn-bhasin","true-citra","djwhal-khul"],"type":"string"},"ayanamsaId":{"type":["number","null"]},"city":{"default":"","type":"string"},"cosmogram":{"type":"boolean"},"date":{"pattern":"^\\d{4}-\\d{2}-\\d{2}$","type":"string"},"houseSystem":{"default":"P","enum":["P","K","R","C","E","W","B","M","O","A","T","V","D","F","G","H","I","i","L","N","Q","S","U","X","Y"],"type":"string"},"latitude":{"maximum":90,"minimum":-90,"type":"number"},"longitude":{"maximum":180,"minimum":-180,"type":"number"},"name":{"default":"","type":"string"},"time":{"pattern":"^\\d{2}:\\d{2}(:\\d{2})?$","type":"string"},"timezone":{"description":"IANA zone name s